<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Growth ($249/month, Pay-as-You-Go)</h3>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 my-4 space-y-1">
<li>1,000,000 LLM requests per month</li>
